<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50682" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππ-άσιμος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fit for
				horses, fit for riding</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἴγυπτον
				τὸ πρὶν ἐοῦσαν ἱππασίμην καὶ ἁμαξευομένην</span>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνιππος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.108
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.63
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				9.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				6.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.49.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				31.1
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἱππάσιμον</span>, i.e.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πεδινόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.2.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἱ. τῆς χώρας ἄνιππα ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					8.4
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς κόλαξιν ἑαυτὸν
				ἀνεικὼς ἱππάσιμον</span> allowing himself <i>to be
				ridden</i> by flatterers, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
